  dialogText:
  - "Your message reds:\"Hey hey hey.\nSo, uh\u2026 not to point fingers but\u2014\""
  - You feed a deep sigh within your belly for a seconds.
  - "If you\u2019re gonna lose your phone, maybe don\u2019t blame the nearest warm
    body. Some of us are barely functioning as-is."
  - '"Anyway, no harm''s done. Right?"'
