  dialogText:
  - "Your message reads: \n\"Hey hey hey. Totally normal message here. Nothing weird.\nSo,
    uh\u2026\""
  - You scratch your cheek and feel the cringe radiate through the screen.
  - "I didn\u2019t steal your phone. You just\u2026 left it. And I just\u2026 existed
    near it."
  - You read it back.
