  dialogText:
  - "Your message reads: \n\"Hey, sorry for being a piece of shit\u2026\nLook, I
    didn\u2019t pick up your phone on purpose. I thought it was mine. They all look
    the same when you\u2019re half-dead and working nights.\""
  - "\"By the time I realized it wasn\u2019t mine, you were already gone. I\u2019m
    an idiot, not a thief.\""
  - You sit there a moment, watching the sentence like it crawled out of a drain.
