  dialogText:
  - "Your messsage reads: \n\"Hey hey hey. So, uh\u2026 heads-up before this sounds
    dumber than it already does\u2014\""
  - Your thumb stalls there for a second over the keys. It makes a small decision.
  - "\"I didn\u2019t steal your phone. I actually found it outside the diner after
    close. Thought someone dropped it running to catch a bus or something.\""
